- Add opt-in expiry payouts with `expiry_payouts`, disabled by default.
  Fix the mode at database creation and refuse a different mode at startup.
  Require joint spending-key and mailbox-key authorization for customer VTXOs.
  [#3](https://github.com/BullishNode/scuttle/pull/3)
- Pay expired customer VTXOs to the entitled owner's mailbox-derived address.
  Apply payout fees and the dust policy. The operator sponsors miner fees;
  fee-child replacements preserve the stored payout parent. On-chain terminal
  status requires six canonical confirmations. Unknown obligations stay held.
  [#3](https://github.com/BullishNode/scuttle/pull/3)
- Preserve uncertain Lightning payments across errors and restarts.
  Only the original task dispatches xpay. Live zero-part codes 205, 206 and 207
  can establish failure after native, source and same-hash checks; empty lookups
  and transport errors alone do not. Use unmodified Core Lightning 26.06.6.
  [#3](https://github.com/BullishNode/scuttle/pull/3)
- Add guarded reconciliation through `captaind rpc reconcile-lightning-attempt`
  on the private administrative listener. Empty-record failure requires the
  operator to confirm a full stop and restart of the same native backend and
  plugins with dispatch excluded. The RPC does not perform or verify that stop.
  [#3](https://github.com/BullishNode/scuttle/pull/3)
- Retry failed hold settlements while other settlements continue.
  Keep the original payment protected until its outcome is resolved.
  [#3](https://github.com/BullishNode/scuttle/pull/3)
